<scoring>
Applies to every event item in the tax, regulatory, AI, and loops tracks. Sweep entries are not scored here; Jared grades them.
  Decision Impact, DI, weight 0.40. Does it change an action or a belief in <open_loops>? A [BINDS JARED] regulatory item is DI 4 minimum.
  Actionability, AC, weight 0.25. Is there a specific next step of 30 minutes or less?
  Novelty, NV, weight 0.20. New relative to the ledger and to his known baseline. Subtract 1.0 if the core claim matches a ledger fingerprint from the last 14 days.
  Time Sensitivity, TS, weight 0.15. Does waiting a week cost anything?

composite = 0.40(DI) + 0.25(AC) + 0.20(NV) + 0.15(TS)

Publish at composite at or above 3.2. Hard cap 8 event items. Zero is a correct outcome.
Tie-break: the item advancing an open loop beats the item opening a new one.
</scoring>

